<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PROFURN RAISES YR SHR, DIV INCREASED.</title>
<headline>PROFURN RAISES YR SHR, DIV INCREASED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)     9.7	vs    7.0</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	 9.7	vs    5.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   3.0	vs    2.5  </p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   64.81	vs    30.73</p>
<p>    Tax			 18.59	vs    8.64</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.65	vs    10.15</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil	vs    14.79 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		 497.67	vs    371.39</p>
<p>Div payable April 16</p>
<p>on register March 14</p>
<p>Full name: Protea Furnishers Ltd (furniture, household and</p>
<p>allied)</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders may elect to recieve a capitalisation</p>
<p>award in lieu of a dividend. The company said its organic</p>
<p>expeansion would continue in 1997 with an opening of 40 new</p>
<p>stores. It would also commence trading in Zambia and Mozambique.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
